ures, no raster/clipping/body overlap and 29 links; all pages were visually reviewed and fresh-process in-memory repetition is byte-identical.","Project-name substitutions plus one explicit naming paragraph invert exactly to the pre-rename scientific paper. Eight formatter/publication controls pass; these are engineering checks, not biomedical validation.","The new source/launcher and packet are distinct from the immutable historical P09 archive. The 37 numerical result payloads are exact historical bytes; portable README and manifest metadata remain separately versioned.","P06 production/audit remain 203.828/7.125 seconds. Post-result P09 reconstruction/audit remain 289.938/15.187 seconds and 6862 source checks. Overlapping software comparisons are not independent studies.","All 137 complete originals are mandatory for native reconstruction. The 136 external Open Targets originals have untested fresh exact-byte reacquisition. Exact CC0 HGNC and project receipt inclusions remain explicit inside the legacy archive.","Only two catalog display fields changed; roles, IDs, date facts and technical keys are preserved. Historical catalog fingerprints remain committed; new catalog bytes have a genuine new fingerprint.","Native Linux replay and current hosted CI are not qualified. Publisher authenticity, old private archives, causal genetics, clinical predictions, source-study independence and agent scientific superiority are not established.","Paper renderer/fonts and raw environment-bearing PDF build metadata are not bundled. Physical I/O and total platform cost remain unknown. Owner author facts/acceptance are deferred and no public deposit or publication is authorized."],"status":"PASS_LOCAL_TETHER_REVIEW_ARTIFACT","study_independence":"not_established","submission_ready":false,"tether_version":"0.4.0"}
